<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<p>Dear&nbsp;{{{Recipient.FirstName}}}<br />
&nbsp;Thank you for accepting your recent quote number <strong>{{{Quote.QuoteNumber}}}</strong>. You are almost ready to use your pricing but we just need to ask you to follow some steps detailed below;<br />
<br />
<strong>For "Spot Rates"</strong></p>

<ul>
	<li>Please advise us when you cut the AWB or AWBs/create your booking/s so the Spot Rate can be applied. This notification needs to be sent to the <span style="color:#2980b9;"><em><u>aucklandfreight@qantas.com.au</u></em></span> and CC to your account manager</li>
	<li>If we are not notified of the AWB number/s you could be charged an incorrect rate which may result in a credit request. Credit requests may result in the CCA fee being applied ($100 per CCA) so to ensure correct billing please notify us as soon as you have your AWBs booked.</li>
</ul>
<br />
<strong>Ongoing rates/Special Lane Pricing</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;

<ul>
	<li>We will apply the agreed rates to the booked AWB or AWBs for the validity period as advised by your account manager (subject to change).</li>
</ul>
<br />
Please reach out to myself or to <span style="color:#2980b9;"><em><u>aucklandfreight@qantas.com.au</u></em></span> if you have any questions in regards to your rate or the application of it.

<p><br />
Regards<br />
{{{Quote.00NMo000002qRSn}}}</p>
</body>
</html>